WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.163
The Democratic Deficit.

00:00:02.113 --> 00:00:04.818
When institutions fail democracy.

00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:07.147
This is the final synthesis.

00:00:07.147 --> 00:00:19.204
Every investigation thread on this site documents the same structural failure: institutions that can investigate but not prosecute, that can find violations but not enforce consequences, that can promise programmes but not deliver them.

00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:22.477
The democratic deficit is not a single scandal.

00:00:22.477 --> 00:00:24.443
It is the architecture.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:27.624
One hundred and eighty investigation pages.

00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:29.249
One pattern.

00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:31.284
Zero accountability.

00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:32.852
The zeros.

00:00:32.852 --> 00:00:37.295
Zero prosecutions for political crimes despite documented evidence.

00:00:37.295 --> 00:00:42.738
Zero registrations in the Foreign Influence Registry after 650 days.

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:47.136
Zero senior military officer convictions through military justice.

00:00:47.136 --> 00:00:52.079
Zero police referrals for 428 MAID regulatory violations.

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:55.602
Zero consequences for Ethics Commissioner findings.

00:00:55.602 --> 00:01:00.306
Zero accountability for the Emergencies Act invocation ruled unreasonable.

00:01:00.306 --> 00:01:04.852
The institutional architecture produces documentation without enforcement.

00:01:04.852 --> 00:01:07.681
Every oversight body can investigate.

00:01:07.681 --> 00:01:09.681
None can prosecute.

00:01:09.681 --> 00:01:11.840
The result: zero.
